<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n69219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῠόω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῦς</span>
		IV) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>make muscular</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.33.6
			</span></i>:— mostly 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be</i> or <i>become muscular</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες μεμυωμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆθος μεμυωμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Hippiatr.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>hard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπλῆνες μεμυωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμυωμένων: μεμυκότων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
